BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 769.0 Td (3. Enrolment) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 750.0 Td (How do I apply?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 736.0 Td (Register on the PM-KISAN portal or at a Common Service Centre, and complete e-KYC.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 717.0 Td (What should I bring?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 703.0 Td (Aadhaar, Land records, Bank account linked to Aadhaar. Bring them in person; never read) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 689.0 Td (document numbers out on the phone.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 670.0 Td (Do I have to pay to apply?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 656.0 Td (There is no fee to apply. Any premium or contribution is only what is stated under What it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 642.0 Td (gives. Never pay anyone or share an OTP to apply.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 615.0 Td (4. Utilisation) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 596.0 Td (How do I know if I'm already enrolled?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 582.0 Td (The agent asks: "Are you already registered for PM-KISAN?") Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 563.0 Td (I'm enrolled. How do I get the benefit?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 549.0 Td (Guidance for the agent: Explain that the benefit is paid into the bank account, how much and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 535.0 Td (how often \(only as stated in the facts\), and that they can check the payment status on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 521.0 Td (official website or helpline.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 494.0 Td (5. Support) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 477.0 Td (Problems people often report:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 462.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 462.0 Td (Benefit or payment not received) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 447.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 447.0 Td (Asked for money) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 432.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 432.0 Td (Name or details wrong) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 417.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 417.0 Td (Refused at office or hospital) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 402.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 402.0 Td (Delay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 387.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 387.0 Td (No response from helpline or office) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 368.0 Td (I have a problem. What should I do?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 354.0 Td (Contact the helpline 155261 or the official website pmkisan.gov.in. If that doesn't solve) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 340.0 Td (it, file a complaint on the government grievance portal, pgportal.gov.in.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 323.0 Td (Don't argue about whether the problem is real, don't promise it will be fixed or by when,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 309.0 Td (and don't ask for any ID, card, account or phone number.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 282.0 Td (6. Feedback) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 265.0 Td (Ask for consent first, then these questions in order:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 250.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 250.0 Td (Did the last payment reach your bank account?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 235.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 235.0 Td (How easy was it to apply and get the benefit, from 1 to 5?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 220.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 220.0 Td (How helpful were the office, bank or helpline staff, from 1 to 5?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 205.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 205.0 Td (Did anyone ask you for extra money to get this benefit?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 190.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 190.0 Td (What one thing would make this scheme work better for you?) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 163.0 Td (Never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 148.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 148.0 Td (Say someone is definitely eligible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 133.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 133.0 Td (Invent amounts, dates, deadlines or rules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 118.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 118.0 Td (Ask for Aadhaar, bank account, card, OTP or PIN numbers, or any payment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 103.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 103.0 Td (Keep talking after the person asks to stop.) Tj ET
